        {
          "text": "Uku ni k’Uhoraho agize, ati Kubg’ ibicumuro bitatu vy’Abayuda, mbere ni bine, sinzovyirengagiza; kuko bātītūye ivyagezwe vyanje, jewe Uhoraho, ntibitondere amabgirizwa yanje, kand’ ibigirwamana vyabo vy’ibinyoma vyarabajimije, ari vyo ba sekuruza babo nyene bākurikira. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.2.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.2.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
